Ordering
Every order is either Dine-in (tied to a table) or Parcel (takeaway). Payment is at the counter in v1 (cash or UPI); online payment comes later.
Each table gets its own QR code that opens /t/{table}, so the table number fills in by itself. A general QR (counter, flyers, Instagram) opens /menu, where the customer picks Dine-in + table or Parcel.
